message: "If you use META-IR in your research, please cite the associated paper."
type: software

title: "META-IR: Meta-Introspective Reasoning for Adaptive Safety Alignment in LLM"

authors:
  - family-names: Miraj
    given-names: Mahabubur Rahman

repository-code: "https://github.com/Miraj-Rahman-AI/Meta-IR"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - Large Language Models
  - LLM Safety
  - Adaptive Safety Alignment
  - Trustworthy AI
  - Introspective Reasoning
  - Monte Carlo Tree Search
  - SI-MCTS
  - Meta-Learning
  - Jailbreak Robustness

abstract: >
  META-IR is a meta-introspective reasoning framework designed to improve
  adaptive safety alignment in Large Language Models. It integrates
  structured introspective reasoning, Safety-Informed Monte Carlo Tree
  Search (SI-MCTS), composite reward optimization, dynamic jailbreak
  simulation, and dual-loop meta-learning.

